  "notes": "Released at Meta Connect 2024 as lightweight text-only 1B and 3B models and 11B and 90B Vision models, the first Llama models with image input. The text model card in llama-models now gives Oct 24, 2024 as Model Release Date, which is the date of the quantized 1B and 3B builds; the launch post, the Vision model card and the Hugging Face model cards of the base 1B and 3B models give September 25, 2024. Quantized builds are listed as aliases of the 1B and 3B variants, not as variants. The record-level input modality describes the text models; the Vision variants add image input."
